+<h1>Electric: rear window and trunk flow</h1>
+<p>A shared curved surface carries the rear glass and painted corners into the trunk, removing the abrupt shelf. Body proportions, front geometry and the small tail lip are retained. <a href="../../ELECTRIC_REAR_FLOW_2026_10_28.md">Changes, verification and limits</a>.</p>
+<div class="facts"><span>Centre join: <b>32.7° → 1.2°</b> slope change</span><span>Full / racing: <b>115,686 / 36,952</b> triangles, unchanged</span></div>
